dist/generated/echarts-6.1.0.json is derived from Apache ECharts 6.1.0 (npm
package echarts@6.1.0): from its TypeScript declarations (types/dist) and, where
the declarations leave a fact out, from its runtime code (lib). Apache ECharts is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Some value lists in it (the names of DOM events, the members of built-in types)
come from the lib files of the TypeScript compiler that read the declarations
(npm package typescript@5.9.3), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

dist/generated/echarts-docs.json lists anchors of the Apache ECharts option
documentation (https://echarts.apache.org/en/option.html), taken from its
option outline (Apache License, Version 2.0); its file names the retrieval date
and digest.

The artifact names each source with its exact version and integrity, and each
fact cites the file and line it was read from. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt carries
the licence and notices of each source, as they ship them, the upstream NOTICE
among them:

